sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Student
    participant V as ApplicationDetailScreen (View)
    participant VM as ApplicationDetailViewModel
    participant AS as ApplicationService
    participant IS as InternshipService
    participant EL as ExternalLinkService
    participant AN as AnalyticsService
    participant FS as Cloud Firestore

    Note over V,FS: 1. Open one application
    Student->>V: taps an Application Card
    V->>VM: provider build (autoDispose.family<..., String>)
    VM->>AS: watchApplications()
    AS->>FS: users/{uid}/applications orderBy appliedAt desc
    VM->>IS: watchByKey(jobKey)
    IS->>FS: internships/{jobKey}
    FS-->>VM: List<InternshipApplication> (live)
    FS-->>VM: Internship? (null once the listing expired)
    VM->>VM: _emit() picks the document whose jobKey matches the route
    VM->>AN: logEvent("view_application", {internship_id, status})
    VM-->>V: ViewData<ApplicationDetail> (application + listing)

    Note over V,FS: 2. Preview the submitted CV (read-only)
    Student->>V: taps "Preview"
    V->>VM: previewCv()
    VM->>EL: open(Uri(cvUrl))
    EL-->>VM: opened, or AppException
    VM-->>V: null (opened) / AppException (View shows message)

    Note over V,FS: 3. Withdraw (Flow 3d)
    Student->>V: taps "Withdraw application"
    V->>V: confirmation dialog (Confirm / Cancel)
    Student->>V: Confirm
    V->>VM: withdraw()
    VM->>VM: guard action.isLoading • status.canWithdraw
    VM-->>V: state.action = AsyncLoading
    VM->>AS: withdraw(jobKey, previous: currentStatus)
    AS->>AS: read stored status it is replacing
    AS->>FS: update {status: withdrawn, withdrawnAt: serverTimestamp, previousStatus}
    alt write succeeds
        FS-->>AS: ack
        AS-->>VM: void
        FS-->>VM: new snapshot (live listener)
        VM->>VM: _emit() → canUndoWithdrawal = withdrawnAt + 24h > now
        VM-->>V: ViewData with Withdrawn badge + Undo (24h window)
    else error
        FS-->>AS: FirebaseException
        AS-->>VM: AppException "we could not withdraw this application"
        VM-->>V: state.action = AsyncError → message + Retry
    end

    Note over V,FS: 4. Undo within the 24-hour window
    Student->>V: taps "Undo withdrawal"
    V->>VM: undoWithdrawal()
    VM->>VM: guard canUndoWithdrawal (deadline from nowProvider)
    VM->>AS: undoWithdrawal(jobKey)
    AS->>FS: update {status: previousStatus, withdrawnAt: FieldValue.delete()}
    FS-->>VM: snapshot with the restored status
    VM-->>V: ViewData with the earlier badge, Undo hidden
